This repository contains multiple kinds of material with different license signals.

Hardware design files: the original p.eda.cn project page lists "CERN Open Hardware License". The exact CERN-OHL variant is not specified on the page captured for this import.

Firmware examples: source files that carry Apache License 2.0 headers remain under Apache-2.0 and retain their original copyright notices.

Documentation, SDK packages and vendor materials: retain their original upstream licenses and notices.

See LICENSES/README.md for operational guidance before reuse or redistribution.
